   "id": 631789,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>Which of the following is the equation of the graph provided?</p>\n<p><img alt=\"GRAPH OF A DECREASING EXPONENTIAL FUNCTION WITH \\(y\\)-intercepts OF 1 AND PASSING THROUGH THE POINT (1, 0.333). THE POINT (1, 0.333) IS LABELED.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"284\" src=\"exercises/media/7ad324f07bef2df7.jpg\" width=\"280\"></p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222767,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y=(\\frac{1}{3})^x\">y=(\\frac{1}{3})^x</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222766,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y= -\\frac{1}{3}x\">y= -\\frac{1}{3}x</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222765,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y= -3x+1\">y= -3x+1</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222764,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y=3^x\">y=3^x</span>"
    }
